### Rust
check-id: "a2p-emit"

#### if_elif.expected.py
```python
def main():
    x = 5
    if x > 10:
        print("big")
    elif x > 3:
        print("medium")
    else:
        print("small")

if __name__ == "__main__":
    main()
```
